There we go. All done.

14
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,000
You could stay here and play with me today. We'll have some fun.

15
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Soul, drag yourself out of bed and eat some breakfast. It's almost time for school.

16
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Oh, good morning, Maka.

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
I have a feeling...

18
