Good morning, Maka.

21
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,100
I have a feeling...

22
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,600
that this particular morning...

23
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,600
Soul?

24
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,600
...is not gonna be cool at all.

25
