How many souls did you collect?

40
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,640
12. How many did you get?

41
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:02,140
So, Maka...

42
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,620
いふfruitな気持ち

43
