dürfen俺とじめる?

44
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,660
メイけの必 sal抱 Saint

45
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:08,560
我 light you're so mad about

46
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,620
I'm not getting начmit

47
00:04:09,620 --> 00:04:10,780
書面内に下化す

48
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,700
マーカー

49
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:16,640
ッ

50
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:23,460
Was there something you wanted to say?

51
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,900
It's about this rumor that's been going around.

52
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:29,460
You know that one teacher we used to have?

53
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,520
The one who died?

54
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:36,140
They found him with a Statue of Liberty sticking out of his brain.

55
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:39,180
Oh, you mean Sid and the Statue to the Forehead incident.

56
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,160
What about it?

57
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,300
You haven't heard?

58
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:46,400
They say there's some weird dude that's been coming after students from the Academy lately.

59
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:49,800
I guess some kid in the next class over got messed up pretty bad.

60
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:55,040
The point is, everyone who's seen this dude, they all say the same thing.

61
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:59,200
They say he was a zombie who had a hole in the middle of his forehead!

62
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,660
Did you really have to hit me again?

63
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:08,260
So your theory is that the zombie is Sid?

64
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:11,660
Please, it's only a story somebody made up to scare everyone.

65
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:14,860
All right, kids, quiet down.

66
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:16,620
Class is about to start.

67
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:25,120
I'm not going to bother taking attendance, but I will tell you one thing right now.

68
00:05:25,980 --> 00:05:30,660
Anyone who thinks the bell decides when class is over is wrong.

69
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:31,360
I do.

70
00:05:31,540 --> 00:05:31,760
Clear?

71
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:36,560
How was that, Maka?

72
00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:38,740
Isn't your old man cool?

73
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:40,940
Hey.

74
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:45,980
Is it just me, or is that stupid father of yours making that goofy face right at us?

75
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:48,140
Um, I think it's just you.

76
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,800
Please do not refer to him as my father.

77
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,840
What's up with this death site?

78
00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:55,220
Are you supposed to be our new teacher now or something?

79
00:05:55,220 --> 00:06:00,000
I'm just a substitute until they find someone who can fill Sid's position permanently.

80
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,980
But that still means I'm in charge of this class.

81
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:06,600
So as long as I'm here, you will call me Professor Death Scythe.

82
00:06:07,780 --> 00:06:08,560
All right, then.

83
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,480
Let's take attendance.

84
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:11,700
You said you weren't going to take role.

85
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:14,040
I'm not going to take attendance for the guys.

86
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:16,400
But I think I will for all the ladies.

87
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:18,040
Dammit, quit being a creep!

88
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:19,020
Oh, please.

89
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,500
Who doesn't know when to quit this one?

90
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,380
Soliter, Soliter.

91
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,620
Here it is.

92
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:29,880
For today, you get the lowest grade possible.

93
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:33,820
Okay, let's get this class started now.

94
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,900
Hey, old man, what did you just write down there?

95
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,860
Oh, that reminds me.

96
00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:38,840
Maka and Sol.

97
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,140
What is it now?

98
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,900
Lord Death wants to see you in the death room.

99
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:45,180
You've been excused from class, so get going.

100
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,240
He wants to see us?

101
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,140
Engage the witch hunter.

102
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,200
A remedial lesson in the graveyard?

103
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,000
Hello?

104
00:07:03,140 --> 00:07:05,660
I wonder why Lord Death wants to see us.

105
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,480
Who knows?

106
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:10,100
Look at Sol and Maka down there.

107
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:13,220
They think they can show their backs to me, do they?

108
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:15,200
Tsubaki, let's go.

109
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:15,780
Right.

110
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,920
Assassin's rule number one.

111
00:07:19,580 --> 00:07:21,520
Dissolve in the darkness and erase your breath.

112
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,580
Wait for an opening to attack your target.

113
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,780
Oh, look.

114
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:25,600
It's Blackstar.

115
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:28,380
Why are you standing up there yelling like an idiot?

116
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:33,340
They found us pretty easily.

117
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:37,420
It can be real difficult to hide when you're as big a star as I am.

118
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:38,500
Oh, well.

119
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:41,080
That's a disadvantage I think I can handle.

120
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:43,040
Pretty big of me, huh, Tsubaki?

121
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:44,280
Oh, yes.

122
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:45,880
Seriously?

123
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:48,320
What are you doing here?

124
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:50,560
Were you guys called in to see Lord Death, too?

125
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,720
What if we were?

126
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,880
Here, I'll call him.

127
00:07:55,340 --> 00:07:56,340
4242-564.

128
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:58,960
Whenever you want to knock on Death's door.

129
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:06,720
Lord Death, are you there?

130
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,280
Yeah, yeah.

131
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:09,760
Hi, hello.

132
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:10,460
What's up?

133
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:11,880
Thanks for coming.

134
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:14,260
Scythe Meister Maka reporting in.

135
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:16,480
Yeah, and Dark Arm Meister Blackstar, too.

136
00:08:16,700 --> 00:08:17,400
And Tsubaki.

137
00:08:17,520 --> 00:08:18,160
I'm his partner.

138
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,220
Well, what did you want with us?

139
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:20,960
Right.

140
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:23,400
I have a little assignment for you guys to take on.

141
00:08:23,980 --> 00:08:24,420
Assignment?

142
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:26,720
Some extra lessons.

143
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:27,840
Huh?

144
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:30,280
Those extra lessons that stupid people get?

145
00:08:30,380 --> 00:08:30,960
Those lessons?

146
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:32,400
Well, screw that.

147
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,860
I'm going to be a Death Scythe.

148
00:08:33,940 --> 00:08:35,520
I'm way too cool for extra lessons.

149
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:37,980
Do you remember your duty as Meisters and weapons?

150
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:38,920
Yes.

151
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:41,400
Our duty as Meisters is to feed our weapons

152
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,440
99 Kishin souls and one witch's soul.

153
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:46,220
We collect evil souls in order to keep the world at peace.

154
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,960
We work to create a Death Scythe.

155
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,760
Weapon of the Grim Reaper, Death.

156
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,760
You are absolutely right.

157
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:55,780
But do you know how many souls all of you have managed to collect?

158
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:57,580
Exactly zero.

159
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:04,800
It isn't something to laugh about, Chuckles.

160
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:08,660
Anyway, are you ready to learn what your extra lessons will entail?

161
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,640
Maybe you've already heard the rumors?

162
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:14,280
About Sid, who taught here at the Academy until recently.

163
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:16,740
Sid, I was right.

164
00:09:17,180 --> 00:09:18,420
It wasn't just a story.

165
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:19,360
Yeah.

166
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,580
But a zombie?

167
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:22,420
I always thought he was a really good teacher.

168
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:23,620
You're right.

169
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:26,700
When he was alive, he was regarded as an excellent teacher.

170
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:29,400
But when he became a zombie, he changed.

171
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:31,460
He has been released from the fear of death.

172
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,280
And now he wants others to have the same freedom he does.

173
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:38,020
He is trying to train students to free themselves as well.

174
00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:40,520
But when a student won't listen, Sid attacks.

175
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:44,980
Another difficulty is that we still don't know who changed Sid into a zombie.

176
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,260
Or what their motive could possibly have been.

177
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:48,140
Okay.

178
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,060
You can leave it all to me, sir.

179
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,940
For our extra lesson, we just have to eliminate these guys?

180
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,280
Yep, that's pretty much it.

181
00:09:54,700 --> 00:09:56,860
Now, I don't want to put too much pressure on you.

182
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:59,220
But if you happen to fail at these extra lessons,

183
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,640
then you're all going to be expelled.

184
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:02,760
What?

185
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:04,120
You're gonna kick us out?

186
00:10:04,820 --> 00:10:06,260
There's nothing to worry about.

187
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:08,560
I can take care of guys like this in my sleep.

188
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:21,740
Come out!

189
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,380
Now time's over, zombie!

190
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:25,060
Hey, Tsubaki.

191
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,120
This is Sid's grave, isn't it?

192
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:29,140
Sure this is where we want to start looking?

193
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:31,680
Don't zombies get up and move around a lot?

194
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:33,720
Might as well check this place first

195
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,840
to be sure he isn't here.

196
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:39,480
I'm not gonna let myself get expelled over some walking...

197
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,680
It looks like an ordinary great stone to me.

198
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,240
Come out!

199
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:44,340
I never even listened to your lessons.

200
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,120
So there!

201
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:46,880
So soon.

202
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:48,320
A bit disturbed.

203
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:51,860
I always thought I was a great scythe-meister

204
00:10:51,860 --> 00:10:52,980
like my mother was.

205
00:10:53,340 --> 00:10:55,260
How can I suddenly be expelled?

206
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:58,920
What's up with Magda?

207
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:00,020
She seems kind of down.

208
00:11:00,420 --> 00:11:03,380
Blackstar, aren't you at least a little worried about all this?

209
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:06,380
Where the hell are you hiding?

210
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:07,640
He's sold.

211
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,280
Why don't we go piss on Sid's grave?

212
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:10,440
What do you think about that?

213
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,680
Yeah, and while we're at it,

214
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,140
why don't we take a dump on it, too?

215
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:14,300
Come on, zombie.

216
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,000
Get out here.

217
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:16,560
Don't make us come find you.

218
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:18,060
We know you're around here somewhere.

219
00:11:18,060 --> 00:11:20,180
Are you scared to find us?

220
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:22,960
I think you can stop me.

221
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:30,700
Maka!

222
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,200
Are you scared, girl?

223
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:34,480
Yeah.

224
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:35,860
I think you...

225
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:41,140
That's what Sid's become?

226
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:42,300
I guess so.

227
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:46,680
Maka, soul, blackstar, Tsubaki.

228
00:11:48,260 --> 00:11:49,260
Good morning.

229
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,620
Good afternoon.

230
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,120
Good night.

231
00:11:54,020 --> 00:11:55,880
How have you been in all that?

232
00:11:57,640 --> 00:12:00,120
I always tried to remember my manners.

233
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:02,220
That's the kind of man I was.

234
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,280
Tsubaki, let's get ready to end this guy.

235
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:05,660
Right.

236
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:11,500
And so it begins.

237
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,500
Tell me, Sid,

238
00:12:13,780 --> 00:12:15,380
why are you doing this?

239
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:19,180
Ding, dong, dong, ding.

240
00:12:20,180 --> 00:12:21,460
Being a zombie's amazing.

241
00:12:22,180 --> 00:12:24,400
There are so many more things I can get away with now.

242
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:26,740
Class is in session.

243
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:29,880
I always was a man to start class right with the bell.

244
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:31,240
Punctuality is important.

245
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,240
This'll be fun.

246
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,600
I get to teach you a lesson now, teacher.

247
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:36,420
And since it's coming for me,

248
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,860
you know it'll be a big one.

249
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:39,460
We don't want to be expelled,

250
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:41,100
so we'll take your extra lesson.

251
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:43,060
But I gotta say,

252
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:44,140
I don't know what we're gonna learn

253
00:12:44,140 --> 00:12:45,640
from a decaying piece of flesh.

254
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,400
If you become a zombie,

255
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,460
then death no longer looms over you.

256
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:51,920
You can escape from fear and be free.

257
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,740
That's wrong and you know it.

258
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:56,460
You were never the type of man who would say that.

259
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,460
And you'll understand when you're...

260
00:12:58,460 --> 00:13:01,580
Blackstar,

261
00:13:01,780 --> 00:13:03,940
there'll be no need to thank me for the lesson.

262
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:05,220
It's on the house.

263
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,200
I never was the kind of man...

264
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,060
Hold back!

265
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:13,660
I'd recommend you just give up.

266
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,560
You one-star Meisters don't have a chance of beating me.

267
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:17,360
I'm hungry!

268
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,380
Can we just get his damn zombie soul already?

269
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:20,600
Sid's right.

270
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:21,740
He is very strong.

271
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:24,640
One-star Meisters like us can't compete with him.

272
00:13:25,020 --> 00:13:26,040
When he was alive,

273
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:28,120
he was designated a three-star Meister.

274
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:30,080
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

275
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,740
Hey, Sid,

276
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:34,220
if you keep swinging your tombstone around like that,

277
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,580
you might bang it into your fat head and die again.

278
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,140
It's my tombstone.

279
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,460
I can use it however I want, can't I?

280
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:42,060
Now then, kids,

281
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,740
it's time for second period.

282
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:48,220
Ding, dong, dong, ding.

283
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:51,580
Oh, yeah, I forgot to mention when this lesson is over,

284
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,660
you're all gonna die.

285
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:58,000
Then I guess we'll be cutting class today.

286
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:01,040
Think I'll go home and take a nice hot bath.

287
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:14,000
Maybe I should take some classes, too.

288
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:19,640
I bet Maka and Sol are having lots of fun right now.

289
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:23,880
What's wrong?

290
00:14:24,060 --> 00:14:25,320
Why aren't you working together?

291
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:27,460
You have to establish a connection

292
00:14:27,460 --> 00:14:29,240
between the souls of Weapon and Meister.

293
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:31,000
You're giving advice to the enemy?

294
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,700
I've always been an enthusiastic educator.

295
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:36,840
That's the kind of man I was.

296
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:39,160
And now I'll teach you how to die.

297
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:42,080
The living...

298
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:47,840
Black Star!

299
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,340
Sid was a Knifemeister.

300
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:54,420
But even without his blade,

301
00:14:54,540 --> 00:14:55,420
the way he fights,

302
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:57,460
that tombstone is all he needs.

303
00:14:57,460 --> 00:14:59,680
So this

304
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:02,060
is a three-star Meister.

305
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:06,760
Ding, dong, dong, ding.

306
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:10,100
Looks like class is over.

307
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:12,380
Ready to die yet, girl?

308
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:14,580
Well, what do you say?

309
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:16,100
Aren't you afraid of dying?

310
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:17,880
If you become a zombie,

311
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:20,120
then you'll be free from that fear of death forever.

312
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:22,740
Ugh, my head is killing me.

313
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:25,540
Your preaching is starting to give me a headache,

314
00:15:25,660 --> 00:15:26,600
you damn zombie.

315
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:29,780
I'm not listening to any lesson of yours.

316
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:31,400
It doesn't matter what you say.

317
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:34,360
Who's gonna pay attention to a rotting corpse like you?

318
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:37,360
As long as there's a big star like me around!

319
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:40,460
Being a three-star Meister doesn't matter!

320
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:42,680
I am...

321
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:44,840
Black Star!

322
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,260
He aimed for the solar plexus,

323
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:51,060
the weakest point in the center of the body.

324
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:53,220
Hmm, that was a nice attack.

325
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:56,560
As one would expect from a dark assassin like Black Star.

326
00:15:57,100 --> 00:15:57,680
Subaki!

327
00:15:58,060 --> 00:15:58,700
Shuriken mode!

328
00:15:59,240 --> 00:15:59,560
Right!

329
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,520
You can't run away!

330
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,880
As if I'd even try!

331
00:16:07,340 --> 00:16:08,240
Maka, he's coming!

332
00:16:09,140 --> 00:16:10,740
The living...

333
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:17,320
What the...

334
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:21,140
She avoided it with such a narrow margin for error.

335
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:23,300
People need fear to survive.

336
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:25,960
We experience it so that we can grow stronger!

337
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:26,700
Hmm?

338
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:29,460
Oh!

339
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,800
If she wasn't afraid in this situation,

340
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:34,960
I'd call that reckless.

341
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:38,860
But Maka has the courage to fight in spite of her fear.

342
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:46,820
Maka.

343
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:50,000
Let's do what he said.

344
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,000
See if you can match my soul's wavelength.

345
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:55,140
But that hasn't worked for us a single time before.

346
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,640
So what?

347
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:58,160
This is us.

348
00:16:58,220 --> 00:16:58,820
We can do it.

349
00:16:58,820 --> 00:16:59,820
Hmm.

350
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,480
Let's go!

351
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,480
Soul Resonance!

352
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:25,640
The legendary super skill of the Scythe Meister!

353
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,160
Witch Hunter!

354
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:49,420
You're trying to kill us?

355
00:17:49,420 --> 00:17:50,420
What the hell, Marco?

356
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:51,040
Nice!

357
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,500
This is all your fault!

358
00:17:52,500 --> 00:17:53,620
Do it right, idiot!

359
00:17:53,620 --> 00:17:54,120
What?

360
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:55,420
You've got to be kidding me!

361
00:17:55,420 --> 00:17:56,640
Why is this my fault?

362
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:59,080
You're the idiot here getting mad at me for nothing!

363
00:17:59,080 --> 00:17:59,580
Die!

364
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:00,380
Die?

365
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:01,340
How can you say that?

366
00:18:01,340 --> 00:18:02,800
That was incredible power!

367
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:03,380
You cry, baby!

368
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:05,760
I wanted to do it without a super skill!

369
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:09,180
I just wanted to do things that Scythe Meister might!

370
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:10,600
Huh?

371
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,780
He's gone.

372
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:12,380
No.

373
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:13,720
He's hiding underground.

374
00:18:14,340 --> 00:18:15,140
He's down there?

375
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:24,580
Damn!

376
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:26,280
He dodged our attack again.

377
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:28,760
Now, Blackstar.

378
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,360
Yeah, I got it.

379
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:35,400
What Scythe's doing now is using the first of the Assassin's rules.

380
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:38,300
Dissolve in the darkness and erase your breath.

381
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:41,020
Wait for an opening to attack your target.

382
00:18:43,620 --> 00:18:44,140
Tsubaki.

383
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:47,560
Let's get a step ahead of this guy.

384
00:18:47,940 --> 00:18:48,340
Right.

385
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:55,260
You zombie bastard.

386
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:57,960
You're not going to upstage me in this performance.

387
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,720
Blackstar's movements seem different from usual.

388
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,800
Only one man is going to die in this graveyard.

389
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,340
But it's not going to be me.

390
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,300
Trapstar.

391
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:16,800
Assassin's rule number two.

392
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:32,260
Concentrate on the target.

393
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:35,420
If I listen carefully, I can hear his soul's wavelength.

394
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:38,580
I can pick it up through Tsubaki.

395
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:45,960
This breathing stopped.

396
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:47,240
And now?

397
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,960
Blackstar activate!

398
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:57,380
I think that it's about time to send you back to the grave.

399
00:19:57,380 --> 00:19:58,840
You really stink.

400
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:05,460
What are you doing?

401
00:20:05,540 --> 00:20:07,080
Tied me up along with this guy!

402
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:10,380
I wouldn't have to if you didn't get in my way.

403
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:12,080
So far, so good.

404
00:20:12,540 --> 00:20:14,440
Maybe it's time to take a break from this.

405
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:19,700
So now they just have to find the person who turns Sid into a zombie, right?

406
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:20,780
That's right.

407
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:22,320
Who's responsible?

408
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:23,360
Do you know?

409
00:20:26,780 --> 00:20:28,840
He's no ordinary enemy, is he?

410
00:20:29,460 --> 00:20:31,880
You're familiar with my current weapon, right?

411
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:32,700
Death Scythe.

412
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:35,880
And I assume that you have at least heard of the Meister who trained him.

413
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:37,140
Yeah.

414
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:39,280
It was Maka's mother, wasn't it?

415
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:40,460
What about her?

416
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,760
Actually, that's not quite right.

417
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:45,360
Maka's mother was Death Scythe's second partner.

418
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:46,520
He had another.

419
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:49,380
So that means...

420
00:20:49,380 --> 00:20:51,640
this person was his first.

421
00:20:52,320 --> 00:20:52,740
Yes.

422
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:55,320
The man behind this is Dr. Frankenstein.

423
00:20:55,980 --> 00:20:58,500
And not only was he Death Scythe's first partner,

424
00:20:58,980 --> 00:21:02,920
he was also unquestionably the greatest Meister to ever graduate from the Academy.

425
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:11,520
I can't seem to get my head on straight.

426
00:21:16,300 --> 00:21:17,420
I give up.

427
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:19,820
Too tired.

428
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:33,480
He's here.

429
00:21:33,480 --> 00:22:03,460
He's here.

430
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:33,460
We'll be right back.

431
00:22:33,480 --> 00:23:03,460
Thank you.

432
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:33,460
Thank you.

433
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:35,480
Thank you.

